# React Component Rules
- Use function keyword: `export function ComponentName(props: Props) {}`
- Every component has a Props interface even if empty.
- Hooks order: useState -> useEffect -> custom hooks -> handlers -> render.
- Loading states required for every async operation.
- Error boundaries at page level. Components catch errors in handlers.
- Use shadcn/ui primitives from @/components/ui/.
- Audio playback via AudioContext, NEVER <audio> element.
- No default exports except page.tsx (Next.js requirement).
- console.error with context: console.error('[ComponentName] description:', error)
